&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;＋&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10pt;"&gt;発行又は処分株式数 × １株当たり払込金額&lt;/p&gt;
